---

<Layout>
	<h1>Hi!, I'm jake hopkins</h1>
	<p>I love building things, whether it be <a href={screen_break}>a widget to help with your screen time</a>, or <a href={juggling_machine}>an automatic juggling machine</a>. 
		Most of my projects are hardware related, but you'll definitely find me dabling in software from time to time, iterating my next neural network, or learning the basics of selfhosting.
	</p>

	<p>Located in the Bay Area, you might find at FRC tournamounts, where I'm the chief engineer for team 11243, or pulling an all nighter at a hackathon. But above all else I'm just having fun, and learning everything I can</p>
	<p>You can find me on <a href={github}> github</a>, or email me at</p>
</Layout>
